// Procs ported content calls from quests not yet ported. Each stands in for
// its quest and does nothing until the quest's own file arrives; then delete
// it here (the quest's port defines it).

// Black Knights' Fortress (quest_blackknight.rs2): the fortress knights
// attack whoever climbs into their room. 289's ladders.rs2 calls it.
[proc,black_knights_aggro](coord $first_search_coord, coord $all_search_coord)

// The Grand Tree (quest_grandtree.rs2): Charlie appears in the jail during
// the quest. 289's ladders.rs2 calls it.
[proc,grandtree_spawn_charlie]

// The Knight's Sword (quest_squire.rs2): Sir Vyvin guards his cupboard once
// the quest reaches it. 289's cupboards.rs2 calls it only when %squire is 5
// or more; nothing in 647 sets %squire yet.
[proc,vyvin_distracted]()(boolean)
return(true);
